# Regex-Muster für Titel ohne Forschungsinhalt (Errata, Leserbriefe, ...); case-insensitive
^correction to\b
^corrigendum\b
^erratum\b
^author correction\b
^retraction\b
^retracted:
^withdrawn:
^expression of concern\b
^reply to\b
^response to\b
^reply\b
^response by\b
^letters?\b
^comments? on\b
\bregarding article\b
\bto the editor\b
(?:^|[\s\.\-–:])reply\.?$
^weekly journal scan\b
^journal scan\b
^in this issue\b
^this week in\b
^editor'?s? (?:note|choice|comment)\b
